              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gajeatayda sea haleanjeeda ghadooweeda bea galeagasean, ea haleanjeadaanyi bea ghadooweeda was booga, gajoatayda haleanjeeni sea haleanjeeda nyaawa bea ghadooweeda sileeha. Asi sikteawana adagwandeawa sirjeeda.",
